      "value": "<ul><li>Biker Boot: Utilitarian, Rebellious</li><li>Knee Boot: Elevated, Investment-worthy</li><li>Slouchy Boot: Relaxed, Bohemian</li><li>Ankle Boot: Foundational, Versatile</li><li>Fluffy Boot: Protective, Tactile</li><li>Lace-Up Bootie:  Historical, Formal</li></ul>"
